1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:13,034
Writing, task one. Form number 8. You want to register with a new GP. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,733 --> 00:00:15,599
Why are you looking for a new doctor?

3
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,979
I'm looking for a new doctor because I moved and my old doctor is too far away.

4
00:00:31,867 --> 00:00:34,399
Do you have any health problems or allergies?

5
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:49,029
I have no serious health problems, but I'm allergic to pollen and penicillin.

6
00:00:49,933 --> 00:00:51,512
When can you go to the doctor?

7
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:06,033
I can go to the doctor in the morning before work or on Friday afternoon when I'm free.

8
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:15,769
Fill in form 8 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
